and glamour inherent to the Russell &amp; Bromley brand\u003C/span>\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Russell &amp; Bromley has remained synonymous with expert craftsmanship and fashion-led design since 1880. We elevated the heritage of this trusted shoe maker through curated moments of delight, comfort and modernity.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"_modelApiKey":131,"assetPosition":132,"isWide":9,"assets":133},"module_framed_asset","center",[134],{"copy":32,"asset":135},{"isVideo":84,"videoHeight":33,"videoUrl":136,"videoWidth":31,"image":7},"https://player.vimeo.com/progressive_redirect/playback/1062442933/rendition/1080p/file.mp4?loc=external&signature=4672c82535c551bdcde53704a3276a2e7bb08bb81d7d5245474e65a0a87a80dc&user_id=230135457",{"_modelApiKey":138,"isReversed4060":9,"assets":139},"module_side_by_side_asym",[140,154],{"copy":141,"asset":142},"Bringing designated story telling in a contemporay and elegant way. Layering texture and materiality to engage, attract and showcase the product.",{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":31,"videoUrl":32,"videoWidth":33,"image":143},{"width":144,"height":145,"url":146,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":147},1774,2192,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731333136-10064_4342a-1.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":148,"srcSet":149,"src":150,"width":151,"height":152,"sizes":153},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731333136-10064_4342a-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2000 500w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731333136-10064_4342a-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2000 1000w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731333136-10064_4342a-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2000 1500w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731333136-10064_4342a-1.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2000 2000w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731333136-10064_4342a-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=2000 500w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731333136-10064_4342a-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=2000 1000w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731333136-10064_4342a-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=cro